---
// Modern Tailwind CSS v4 wrap-break-word on code and whitespace-nowrap
---
<section class="max-w-md mx-auto p-4">
  <div class="whitespace-nowrap wrap-break-word font-sans text-xs">
    <span>Token: 0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef</span>
  </div>
  <code class="wrap-break-word text-sm bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800">
    git clone https://github.com/will2469/charites.git
  </code>
</section>
